      },
      "estleg:versionText": "Senine kohtute seadus (RT 1991, 38, 472; 1993, 1, 2; RT I 1993, 24, 429; 65, 922; 1994, 81, 1382; 86/87, 1487; 94, 1609; 1995, 29, 358; 87, 1540; 1996, 31, 631; 42, 811; 51, 967; 1998, 4, 62; 2000, 35, 219; 51, 321; 2001, 21, 113; 43, 240; 48, 264) tunnistatakse kehtetuks.",
      "rdfs:label": {
